@@ -31,3 +31,19 @@ These assets are intended for downstream LoRA training and label-based routing e
 ## Notes
 
 This branch is intentionally limited to the collaborator-facing artifacts and excludes experimental logs, scratch analysis, and in-progress work.
+
+## Persona LoRA SFT
+
+The bundle contains labels and persona prompts, but not the original problem statements or
+supervised reference solutions. Prepare an ACC train JSONL whose `id` values match
+`binning_train_full.binned.jsonl` and whose rows contain `solution` or `ground_truth`, then run:
+
+```bash
+SOURCE_JSONL=/path/to/acc_train.jsonl \
+  bash scripts/sbatch/launch_acc_seed20211004_persona_sft.sh
+```
+
+The launcher validates the ID join and target availability, creates
+`export/acc_binning_seed20211004_persona`, and submits one LoRA job per roster expert. Each
+adapter sees only rows where its `per_expert` label is 1, with that expert's `system_prompt`
+from `roster_final.json` as the training system message.
